<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 36px; padding-bottom: 60px;">
  <div class="section-head" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px;">
    <div class="pill-badge green" style="margin: 0 auto 12px;">Android 8.0 se Android 14+ Supported</div>
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-heading); letter-spacing: -0.8px;">
      How to install <%= settings.siteName %>
    </h1>
    <p style="max-width: 580px; margin: 8px auto 20px; font-size: 16.5px; color: var(--text-muted);">
      Sirf 2 minute ka aasan process. Niche diye button se official APK download karein.
    </p>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px;">
      <a class="btn" href="/download">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM17 13l-5 5-5-5h3V9h4v4h3z"/></svg>
        Download <%= settings.siteName %> APK
      </a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/faq">
        Common Questions
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-meta" style="justify-content: center;">
      <span>Version <%= settings.appVersion %></span>
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span>Size: <%= settings.apkFileSize %></span>
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span style="color: var(--success); font-weight: 700;">10 Free Rides Included</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Step-by-Step Installation Cards -->
  <div class="card card-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>4 Aasan Steps me Install &amp; Setup Karein</h2>
      <p>Download hone ke baad apne phone me ye aasan steps follow karein:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-container">
      <div class="step-row">
        <div class="step-badge">1</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>APK File Download &amp; Open Karein</h4>
          <p>Upar diye button par click karke file download karein. Download poora hone par notification ya Downloads folder se file open karein. Chrome agar "Install unknown apps" pooche, toh <strong>Allow</strong> kar dein.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-row">
        <div class="step-badge">2</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>Mobile Number Se Sign In Karein</h4>
          <p>App open karke apna 10-digit mobile number enter karein. Har naye captain ko turant <strong>10 Free Trial Rides</strong> mil jaati hain.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-row">
        <div class="step-badge">3</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>Accessibility Permission Allow Karein</h4>
          <p>App me Accessibility switch on karein. Yahi feature aapke driver apps (Rapido, Uber, Porter) ke booking cards ko padhta hai taaki ride auto-filter ho sake. Ye kisi bhi private data ya password ko access nahi karta.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-row">
        <div class="step-badge">4</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>Display Over Other Apps (Floating Button)</h4>
          <p>Floating control switch on karein taaki screen par chhota icon dikhe. Isse aap chalte-chalte bhi filter on/off ya pause kar sakte hain.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Play Protect Guidance -->
  <div class="card card-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Agar Play Protect Warning Aaye Toh Kya Karein?</h2>
      <p>Google Play Store se bahar install hone wali har naye app par Android ek security note dikhata hai. Isse ghabrane ki zaroorat nahi hai:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="notice-box info">
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="flex-shrink:0; color:var(--brand-primary);"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm-2 16l-4-4 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l6.59-6.59L18 9l-8 8z"/></svg>
      <div>
        <strong>Aapko Play Protect band karne ki koi zaroorat nahi hai:</strong><br>
        1. Screen par <strong>"More details"</strong> par tap karein.<br>
        2. Uske baad <strong>"Install anyway"</strong> par tap karein. Install 2 second me complete ho jayega.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Android 13/14 Restricted Settings -->
  <div class="card card-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Android 13 ya 14 par "Restricted Setting" Aaye Toh?</h2>
      <p>Naye Android phones me Accessibility on karte waqt <em>"Restricted setting"</em> likha aaye toh ye ek-time setting karni hoti hai:</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="delform" style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-body);">
      <li>Phone ke <strong>Settings</strong> &rarr; <strong>Apps</strong> &rarr; <strong><%= settings.siteName %></strong> me jayein.</li>
      <li>Upar right corner me <strong>3 dots (⋮)</strong> par tap karein.</li>
      <li><strong>"Allow restricted settings"</strong> select karein aur phone ka lock screen PIN daalein.</li>
      <li>Wapas app me aakar Accessibility on kar dein — chalu ho jayega!</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <!-- Vivo, Oppo, Realme, Xiaomi Battery Lock -->
  <div class="card card-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Vivo, Oppo, Realme aur Xiaomi Phone Ke Liye Zaroori</h2>
      <p>Ye phones background apps ko band kar dete hain. Shift ke dauran app active rahe, isliye ye 2 settings zaroor karein:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h4>🔋 Battery Optimization Off</h4>
        <p>Settings &rarr; Battery &rarr; <%= settings.siteName %> &rarr; <strong>"Don't optimize" / "Allow background activity"</strong> chunein.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h4>🔒 App Lock in Recent Apps</h4>
        <p>Recent apps menu kholein, <%= settings.siteName %> par press karke <strong>Lock icon</strong> daba dein taaki clearing se app close na ho.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="notice-box">
    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="flex-shrink:0; color:var(--warning);"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z"/></svg>
    <div>
      <strong>Suraksha ki guarantee:</strong> Hamesha official <%= settings.siteName %> website se hi download karein. Hum kabhi bhi aapka OTP, ride app password ya UPI PIN nahi maangte.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
